  "modifications": "Local quoted header includes; replace unused private net/dlil.h dependency with existing KPI include and IFNET_MODIDLEN/IFNET_MODARGLEN public aliases (same sizes20/12). Original licenses retained.; IOMbufMemoryCursor limits explicit C linkage to m_getpackets declaration, leaving XNU C++ template-bearing includes outside.; IONetworkInterface explicitly imports real OSMetaClass ownership annotations before BSD bpf/skywalk.",
  "build_adaptations": {
    "family_private_spi": "Parent-owned Makefile must define __PRIVATE_SPI__=1 for every network object; matches original pinned project GCC_PREPROCESSOR_DEFINITIONS, no declarations or enum values fabricated.",
    "target_conditionals": "IONetworkInterface.cpp and IOKernelDebugger.cpp include source-owned A04BR3FamilyTarget.h; only consumed TARGET_OS_IPHONE derived from explicit target or board/XNU defines. No SDK system header dependency.",
    "xnu8796_header_linkage": "Removed blanket extern-C around BSD/header-only types; real XNU headers own linkage and may import kern/startup C++ templates. Explicit C function declarations in IOMbufMemoryCursor/IOKernelDebugger preserved.",
    "ownership_annotations": "IONetworkInterface/IONetworkStack load real IOKit/IOLib before BSD headers, so OSMetaClass LIBKERN_CONSUMED exists before bpf/skywalk.",
    "bpf_mode_names": "if_set_bpf_tap switch now uses exact exported kpi_interface.h BPF_MODE_DISABLED/INPUT/OUTPUT/INPUT_OUTPUT values (0/1/2/3) rather than private dlil aliases.",
    "shared_backing_lifecycle": "Protected nonvirtual adopt/clear seam adds independent ifnet_reference to actual base private _backingIfnet; adopts before bridge ifnet_attach, clears and releases after actual bridge detach completes. Default allocation not called; genuine base free is fallback reference cleanup. No parent IOEthernetInterface.cpp changes.",
    "ios16_stack_authorization": "A04BR3-only compatibility: retain superclass init and actual administrator check. Dedicated com.apple.networking.ionetworkstack.user-client, if present, must be canonical true; false/malformed denies without fallback. Only if absent, accept an actual owning-task signed com.apple.security.iokit-user-client-class array containing exact IONetworkStackUserClient; malformed arrays and root-only callers denied. Observed donor configd signed XML supplies that exact class grant. No task-name, process-name or fabricated entitlement. Runtime IOServiceOpen errno remains unobserved."
  },
