  "a04_kernel_registration": "Original nonvirtual registerKernelInterface reuses interfacePublished then registerNetworkInterface (reserve/open/name/BSDattach). Board controller delays nub publication until this synchronous path. No second ifnet or IOClass/BSDname property substitution; no private ABI emulation."
}
